==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|cease||stop}}, and {{m|en|desist||to not do again}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|cease<> and desist<>}}

# {{lb|en|legal}} To stop and not resume an action.
#: {{ux|en|We are told to '''cease and desist''' or we will cease to exist.}}

