===Noun===
{{en-noun|?}}

# {{lb|en|legal|mostly|attributive}} A demand that a party stops and does not resume a certain behavior, such as [[copyright infringement]], [[slander]], or [[libel]], indicating that the issuer will pursue legal action if the recipient fails to do so.
#: {{ux|en|She received a '''cease and desist''' letter from his solicitors soon after the podcast.}}
# {{lb|en|US|legal|mostly|attributive}} An order by a government agency, [[sanction]]ed by a court, that one stop and not resume continuing a certain illegal behavior.
#: {{ux|en|His remarks did not stop the courts from issuing the '''cease and desist''' order.}}

